The '''Archaeologist''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{Zone|Archaeologist's Camp}}, on the {{zone|Spiders Den}}. They give the player the {{Item|Archaeologist's Compass}} and ask them to find {{Green|28}} hidden [[Relics]] spread across the {{zone|Spiders Den}}, rewarding them {{c|10k}} for each and an additional {{c|30k}} after finding them all.

